  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "品牌與行銷文案設計",
    "sub_ename": "BRANDING AND COPYWRITING  FOR  MARKETING  DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "一、本課程目的是提升學生品牌知識，使學生可以撰寫與眾不同市場行銷文案。\n\n二、本課程旨在幫助學生理解當前品牌發展，培養學生品牌管理必要的技能並加強學生品牌分析和洞察力。\n\n三、學生將學習撰寫成功文案的技能，並且能夠應用相關理論在制定有效的宣傳策略上。",
    "describe_eh": "Firstly, this module aims to expand students' brand knowledge, enabling students to write a distinct advertising plan. Secondly, this course intends to provide students with an understanding of the issues surrounding the role of the brand in the current context. This is necessary to develop students' skills in brand management and strengthen their ability to apply appropriate materials and academic models for brand analysis and insight. Thirdly, this course will allow students to acquire the skills of successful copywriting so that they become able to apply the theoretical knowledge they gain in developing effective campaign strategies.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解品牌之策略重要性",
      "describe_en": "Describe the strategic role of the brand within the organisation's marketing strategy"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "評估行銷文案與品牌定位之契合度",
      "describe_en": "Assess the fit between the desired positioning of a given brand and decisions"
    }
  ],
